//~ FLICK-G005 @37:32-37:33
//~ FLICK-G005 @37:36-37:37
//~ FLICK-T071 @45:25-45:32
//~ FLICK-T071 @51:34-51:42
//~ FLICK-G004 @58:23-58:28
//~ FLICK-G004 @62:32-62:37
//~ FLICK-G003 @70:35-70:46 the child holds region `outer`, which may end before its owner `s`
//~ FLICK-G003 @75:35-75:46 this keeps work that uses `Greeter` until `s` closes
//~ FLICK-T008 @83:13-83:26 expected `Scope s`, found `Scope outer`
